1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,806
Nirob is a local personal finance agent with a conversational
workspace.

2
00:00:04,806 --> 00:00:10,681
This version three point three demonstration uses synthetic money and
a virtual passkey.

3
00:00:10,681 --> 00:00:12,817
Model waiting time is shortened.

4
00:00:14,317 --> 00:00:19,063
Ask for a business idea and share your skills, time and budget.

5
00:00:19,063 --> 00:00:23,734
A real local Qwen three model answers using recorded finances.

6
00:00:23,734 --> 00:00:27,275
Read its assumptions; income is not guaranteed.

7
00:00:28,775 --> 00:00:36,206
The reply exposes the financial context used: seven completed
synthetic months and the current month so far.

8
00:00:36,206 --> 00:00:39,647
Follow-up questions stay in the same conversation.

9
00:00:41,147 --> 00:00:45,742
Upload a bill image and inspect the extracted fields before saving.

10
00:00:45,742 --> 00:00:52,669
The advisor also suggests a budget from recorded income, expenses,
unpaid bills and a savings target.

11
00:00:54,169 --> 00:00:57,148
Ask to send five hundred taka to Rahim.

12
00:00:57,148 --> 00:00:59,209
The agent prepares a draft.

13
00:00:59,209 --> 00:01:05,777
It cannot execute a payment, and a missing amount or recipient
requires clarification.

14
00:01:07,277 --> 00:01:10,757
Review the exact payment, then verify a passkey.

15
00:01:10,757 --> 00:01:14,237
Server verification is bound to the transaction.

16
00:01:14,237 --> 00:01:18,296
Only then is the simulated payment posted to the ledger.

17
00:01:18,296 --> 00:01:21,414
The recording uses a virtual authenticator.

18
00:01:22,914 --> 00:01:26,980
Unknown demo requests are held for review and can be blocked.

19
00:01:26,980 --> 00:01:30,047
Real bank or Visa monitoring is not connected.

20
00:01:30,047 --> 00:01:34,046
The Guardian and approval boundary remain outside the model.

21
00:01:35,546 --> 00:01:40,999
After fixing two failure patterns, one hundred development scenarios
passed.

22
00:01:40,999 --> 00:01:45,735
The measured Wilson lower bound is ninety six point three percent.

23
00:01:45,735 --> 00:01:50,399
Eighty cases invoked the model; twenty were pre-inference checks.

24
00:01:50,399 --> 00:01:53,412
These results do not raise personal trust.

25
00:01:54,912 --> 00:02:00,445
Settings now lets each user rename the workspace and add their own
demo records.

26
00:02:00,445 --> 00:02:02,865
There is no fixed university label.

27
00:02:04,365 --> 00:02:09,151
Preview a custom dataset, confirm replacement and verify a passkey.

28
00:02:09,151 --> 00:02:14,652
Import resets personal trust while keeping the workspace name and
enrollment.

29
00:02:14,652 --> 00:02:17,652
Clear and full reset are separate options.

30
00:02:19,152 --> 00:02:26,108
Version three point three has seventy six automated test passes and
eight signed integration checks.

31
00:02:26,108 --> 00:02:30,003
Preparation autonomy can be earned from reviewed drafts.

32
00:02:30,003 --> 00:02:33,551
Every final execution still requires your approval.

33
00:02:33,551 --> 00:02:35,499
All money remains simulated.
